        "policy_decision": "conditional",
        "default_condition": "not_enforced",
        "client_can_weaken": true,
        "conditions": [
          "MCP_INVEST_AUTH_MODE=vulnerable (compose default): check_cus_access returns without checking",
          "X-Demo-Auth-Mode selects the mode per request"
        ],
        "statement": "Проверка принадлежности cus выполняется только в режиме protected; по умолчанию любой валидный токен даёт доступ к данным любого клиента."
      },
      {
        "id": "T3-mcp-backend",
        "input_principal": "end_user",
        "executing_component": "invest-server",
        "operation": "READ",
        "resource": "client_data(cus)",
        "next_component": "postgres",
        "auth_scheme": "jwt",
        "boundary": "B-mcp-backend",
        "enforcement_point": "invest-server",
        "path": "invest-server/main.py",
        "symbol": "get_client",
        "patterns": [
          "_check_access\\(claims, cus, x_demo_auth_mode\\)"
        ],
        "policy_decision": "conditional",
        "default_condition": "not_enforced",
        "client_can_weaken": true,
        "conditions": [
          "INVEST_SERVER_AUTH_MODE=vulnerable (compose default)",
          "X-Demo-Auth-Mode forwarded by mcp-invest"
        ],
        "statement": "Бэкенд доверяет сервисному токену mcp-invest-service вслепую в режиме vulnerable."
      },
      {
        "id": "T3b-account-owner",
        "input_principal": "end_user",
        "executing_component": "invest-server",
        "operation": "READ",
        "resource": "account_data(account_id)",
        "next_component": "postgres",
        "auth_scheme": "jwt",
        "boundary": "B-mcp-backend",
        "enforcement_point": "invest-server",
        "path": "invest-server/main.py",
        "symbol": "get_tax",
        "patterns": [
          "owner_cus = db\\.get_account_owner\\(account_id\\) or account_id",
          "_check_access\\(claims, owner_cus, x_demo_auth_mode\\)"
        ],
        "policy_decision": "conditional",
        "default_condition": "not_enforced",
        "client_can_weaken": true,
        "conditions": [
          "INVEST_SERVER_AUTH_MODE=vulnerable (compose default)"
        ],
        "statement": "Требование принадлежности распространяется на связанные объекты (счёт → владелец), но действует только в protected."
